    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "The DNA of a space virus underwent a\nsudden mutation upon exposure to a\nlaser beam and resulted in DEOXYS.\fThe crystalline organ on this POKéMON’s\nchest appears to be its brain.",
